    acceptanceCriteria: [
      '`npm test` checks the database first and stops with the exact "Can\'t reach the database..." message if it is down',
      'API tests and Playwright tests use only bill_splitter_test, which is wiped and rebuilt each run',
      'Playwright runs Chromium, Firefox and WebKit and includes axe WCAG 2.2 AA checks in light and dark mode',
      'With the database running, `npm test` passes twice in a row',
    ],
  },
