All changes are uncommitted: \`git -C ${ROOT} diff\` shows them against the last commit (new files: src/client/components/CurrencyNote.tsx, src/tests/unit/billEditor.test.ts, src/tests/e2e/round2-bills.spec.ts).
Since that review, these fixes were made (verify them, do not assume they are right):
- M1: setParticipants no longer rewrites items; item chips get selected={item.sharerIds.filter(onBill)}; toGroupBillInput sends only sharers still on the bill; isBlankItem counts ticked sharers on by-items bills.
- M2/L10: hooks.ts useSavedBill(loaded) copies savedBillId from history state into component state, clears the history state with navigate({pathname, search}, {replace:true, state:null}), and scrolls the saved row (rowRef) into view (block center) once the list has loaded. Used in SoloPages.tsx (SoloListPage) and GroupPage.tsx (BillsTab).
- M3: the charge switch labels focus the box in onClick when e.detail > 0 (no pointerup/setTimeout).
- M4: an @media (forced-colors: active) block for chips and .seg-on in styles.css.
- M5: the amount radio shows <span>{symbol}</span><span class="visually-hidden"> amount</span>, so its name is e.g. "Rs amount".
- L1-L13 as described in the review (hint "Tick who took part first.", addItem edits 'items', full-width item errors via .item-main > .field {display:contents}, empty-line rules + e.repeat + Enter on an empty last line falls through to Calculate, Remove focuses a neighbour row or "+ Add item", keyCode 229 guard, .bill-side max-height + overflow at >=1180px, .alert + .bill-summary margin, people-row auto-fit + nowrap segments, enterKeyHint removed and the hint reworded "With a keyboard, press Enter after a price to start the next item.", docs reworded, more unit tests, CurrencyNote now always renders the note with hidden={!open}).
